WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.488 --> 00:00:02.622
Biden's speech tomorrow, we are

00:00:02.756 --> 00:00:04.257
seeing this firming up of this

00:00:04.391 --> 00:00:07.894
looking more like a u.s./russia

00:00:07.894 --> 00:00:08.095
war.

00:00:08.228 --> 00:00:10.697
&gt;&gt; Colonel, Beth just talked

00:00:10.831 --> 00:00:12.666
about the symbolism here, and

00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:14.534
there's new military assistance,

00:00:14.668 --> 00:00:16.937
but as far as we know it does

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:21.541
not include the item at the top

00:00:21.908 --> 00:00:24.144
of Ukraine's wish list, U.S.

00:00:24.277 --> 00:00:25.912
Fighter jets.

00:00:25.979 --> 00:00:27.914
Should the U.S. Be sending U.S.

00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:28.248
Fighter jets?

00:00:28.381 --> 00:00:31.151
&gt;&gt; I think at this point we

00:00:31.284 --> 00:00:32.486
should, and I think if we are

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:34.054
doing something like this for

00:00:34.187 --> 00:00:38.925
many months now, ideally we were

00:00:39.059 --> 00:00:40.961
two months into the war when we

00:00:41.094 --> 00:00:42.395
realized the Ukrainians were

00:00:42.529 --> 00:00:44.664
going to stand fast and hold

00:00:44.798 --> 00:00:47.000
territory and regain territory.

00:00:47.134 --> 00:00:49.536
Since we have not done that, now

00:00:49.936 --> 00:00:51.538
is as good as time as any to

00:00:51.938 --> 00:00:53.073
catch up and provide the

00:00:53.206 --> 00:00:54.708
training that the Ukrainian

00:00:54.841 --> 00:00:55.942
pilots will need.

00:00:55.942 --> 00:00:58.311
The short answer is yes to

00:00:58.445 --> 00:01:01.047
planes like the f-16 and also

00:01:01.181 --> 00:01:04.184
yes to longer range missiles.

00:01:04.317 --> 00:01:06.353
&gt;&gt; Beth, we were just talking

00:01:06.486 --> 00:01:10.423
about the military's bloggers

00:01:10.557 --> 00:01:14.628
inside Russia, criticizing

00:01:14.761 --> 00:01:16.196
Russia, for lack of a better

00:01:16.329 --> 00:01:18.565
word, allowing this to happen.

00:01:18.698 --> 00:01:20.534
How do you think all of this

00:01:20.667 --> 00:01:21.968
might affect Putin's speech?

00:01:22.002 --> 00:01:24.638
&gt;&gt; I think he's going through

00:01:24.771 --> 00:01:27.607
his speech right now overnight

00:01:27.974 --> 00:01:30.443
with a red pen and will make

00:01:30.577 --> 00:01:32.145
that language even tougher, even

00:01:32.279 --> 00:01:34.781
more about this being a fight

00:01:34.915 --> 00:01:36.817
between Russia and the U.S.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:40.053
You know, I also expect that

00:01:40.187 --> 00:01:41.988
there's a high potential that we

00:01:42.055 --> 00:01:44.324
will see another missile barrage

00:01:44.457 --> 00:01:46.026
attacking Kyiv because these

00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:49.162
folks on his right flank, on

00:01:49.296 --> 00:01:51.464
Putin's right flank are really

00:01:51.598 --> 00:01:51.998
upset.

00:01:51.998 --> 00:01:53.567
It was all over the Russian TV

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.837
today, pictures of Biden and

00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:59.339
zelenskyy hugging and walking

00:01:59.472 --> 00:01:59.673
around.

00:02:00.006 --> 00:02:00.373
It's infuriating them.

00:02:00.507 --> 00:02:02.175
I think Putin has to show that

00:02:02.309 --> 00:02:04.044
he's a tough guy.

00:02:04.177 --> 00:02:06.646
&gt;&gt; Colonel, to that point I was

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.315
in lviv in Ukraine last March

00:02:08.448 --> 00:02:09.049
when president Biden was

00:02:09.182 --> 00:02:10.684
speaking over the border in

00:02:10.817 --> 00:02:13.687
Poland and Russia conducted air

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:14.888
strikes right before president

00:02:15.021 --> 00:02:16.022
Biden was set to speak.

00:02:16.022 --> 00:02:17.591
You had the sense they did it so

00:02:18.024 --> 00:02:19.025
that all the cameras that we

00:02:19.159 --> 00:02:22.729
were using could see their air

00:02:22.863 --> 00:02:23.063
strikes.

00:02:23.196 --> 00:02:24.764
How concerned should the U.S.

00:02:24.898 --> 00:02:26.800
And should Ukraine be that this

00:02:26.933 --> 00:02:31.471
visit might prompt more Russian

00:02:31.605 --> 00:02:32.038
aggression?

00:02:32.038 --> 00:02:33.540
&gt;&gt; I think quite concerned.

00:02:33.673 --> 00:02:36.042
I think it's really very likely,

00:02:36.042 --> 00:02:38.044
as Beth mentioned, that they

00:02:38.111 --> 00:02:39.713
will start to do something like

00:02:40.046 --> 00:02:40.146
this.

00:02:40.146 --> 00:02:42.582
You know, they have a tendency

00:02:42.716 --> 00:02:44.784
to be very symbolic in their

00:02:44.918 --> 00:02:46.987
actions and their military

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.323
actions tend to be more

00:02:50.457 --> 00:02:52.626
symbolically oriented anyways

00:02:52.759 --> 00:02:53.593
than ours do.

00:02:53.727 --> 00:02:56.563
It becomes a clear need, a clear

00:02:56.696 --> 00:02:58.398
imperative for the Ukrainians to

00:02:58.531 --> 00:02:59.633
be prepared for something like

00:03:00.066 --> 00:03:02.669
this, and to also prepare their

00:03:02.802 --> 00:03:05.105
population that these attacks on

00:03:05.238 --> 00:03:06.806
the infrastructure and other

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.875
military installations will

00:03:09.009 --> 00:03:12.646
continue at this point and will

00:03:12.779 --> 00:03:14.080
get fairly bad.

00:03:14.214 --> 00:03:18.084
&gt;&gt; One crucial meeting today was

00:03:18.084 --> 00:03:25.225
Joe Biden and zelenskyy, but

00:03:25.358 --> 00:03:26.092
inside Russia China's top

00:03:26.126 --> 00:03:31.164
diplomat met with Russian

00:03:31.298 --> 00:03:32.732
officials, and U.S. Officials

00:03:32.866 --> 00:03:34.701
are concerned that China will

00:03:34.834 --> 00:03:36.970
provide lethal military aid to

00:03:37.103 --> 00:03:37.304
Russia.

00:03:37.437 --> 00:03:40.106
How much of a concern should

00:03:40.173 --> 00:03:42.108
that be and what would that do

00:03:42.108 --> 00:03:44.577
to U.S. And China relations?

00:03:44.711 --> 00:03:46.813
&gt;&gt; Well, u.s./china relations

00:03:46.947 --> 00:03:49.316
are at a 40-year low already.

00:03:49.582 --> 00:03:51.584
I think now the effort from both

00:03:51.718 --> 00:03:56.122
sides coming out of Bali was to

00:03:56.256 --> 00:03:58.158
put guardrails on and keep the

00:03:58.291 --> 00:04:00.293
wheels from falling off the bus.

00:04:00.427 --> 00:04:02.796
I think that that would be just

00:04:02.929 --> 00:04:04.130
devastating.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.132
You know, this is really another

00:04:06.132 --> 00:04:07.600
bold move by the Biden

00:04:07.734 --> 00:04:09.169
administration to use

00:04:09.302 --> 00:04:10.303
intelligence, not just keep it

00:04:10.437 --> 00:04:12.339
hidden but to use it in order to

00:04:12.472 --> 00:04:15.742
constrain the actions of our

00:04:16.142 --> 00:04:16.276
adversaries.

00:04:16.276 --> 00:04:18.311
They did it effectively against

00:04:18.445 --> 00:04:21.014
Russia, and I think this will be

00:04:21.147 --> 00:04:22.148
affective against China.

00:04:22.282 --> 00:04:24.784
What Russia is trying to do is

00:04:24.918 --> 00:04:26.619
have its cake and eat it too,

